    "warnings": [
      "The hardness proof account leaves out two decisive steps: a partial-recursive search realizes the marker domain and is compiled into closed lambda terms, while an evaluation-stage witness converts each arbitrary computable Boolean predicate into a primitive-recursive bounded test. Explain these transitions so the account shows how the stated computable-predicate hardness result follows from the marker argument."
